[0.0-3.5] caller: This is your bank's fraud department. We've seen suspicious charges.
[4.1-5.6] elder: Oh no, what charges?
[6.2-10.4] caller: Someone is trying to empty your account. We need to act immediately.
[11.0-12.5] elder: What should I do?
